repository-code: 'https://github.com/icarda/QBMS'
url: 'https://icarda.github.io/QBMS/'
abstract: >-
  QBMS is an R package that assists breeders in linking
  breeding data management systems with analytical
  pipelines. It supports querying and retrieving phenotypic
  and genotypic data from systems including EBS, BMS,
  BreedBase, Germinate, DeltaBreed, and GIGWA through BrAPI.
  It also  provides helper functions for accessing
  environmental data sources  including TerraClimate and the
  FAO HWSD v2 soil database.
